  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>n</mi></math> matrix such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. If the determinant of the matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>Adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>84</mn></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now simplifying,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Adj</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>Adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>Adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>Adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>84</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now comparing both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>21</mn></math></p><p>Now if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;now checking&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>21</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
